========== GET /flights/search
REQ: {"query": [{"name": "departureCode", "type": "string", "required": true, "note": "与 departureAirportCode 做精确等值匹配；代码不校验格式"}, {"name": "arrivalCode", "type": "string", "required": true, "note": "与 arrivalAirportCode 做精确等值匹配"}, {"name": "departureDate", "type": "string", "required": true, "note": "与 departureDate 做精确字符串等值匹配（样本数据形如 2025-11-10）；代码不校验日期格式，不匹配就返回空列表"}]}
 RESP GET /flights/search#responses[0] | 200 success catch= False WHEN: 三个查询参数都提供了非空值（即使没有匹配到任何航班也返回 200，flights 为空数组） BODY: {"fields": ["flights"], "description": "flights 是匹配航班的数组，每项为 Airline-Flight 表里的完整条目；没有匹配时为 []"}
 RESP GET /flights/search#responses[1] | 400 error catch= False WHEN: departureCode、arrivalCode、departureDate 中任意一个缺失或是空字符串，不访问数据库直接返回 BODY: {"fields": ["error"], "description": "error 固定为 'Missing required parameters'"}
 DA: [{"operation": "scan", "table": "Airline-Flight-{stage}", "index": null}]
 RULE GET /flights/search#business_rules[0] | validation | departureCode、arrivalCode、departureDate 三个查询参数必须全部提供且非空（空字符串也算缺失），否则不访问数据库直接返回 400 {"error": "Missing required parameters"}
 RULE GET /flights/search#business_rules[1] | computation | 搜索是按 departureAirportCode、arrivalAirportCode、departureDate 三个字段的精确等值匹配（区分大小写、不校验日期格式），命中的航班条目原样放进 flights 数组返回
 RULE GET /flights/search#business_rules[2] | data_scope | 结果来自整张航班表的 Scan，只取第一次 Scan 响应里的 Items，代码不处理 LastEvaluatedKey，因此数据量大时返回的列表会被截断；端点也没有分页参数
 RULE GET /flights/search#business_rules[3] | error_handling | DynamoDB Scan 抛异常时 storage 层吞掉异常返回空列表，端点因此返回 200 {"flights": []} 而不是 500
 RULE GET /flights/search#business_rules[4] | authorization | 该端点不需要认证，任何人都可以查询航班
========== GET /flights/<flight_id>
REQ: {"path_params": [{"name": "flight_id", "type": "string", "required": true}]}
 RESP GET /flights/<flight_id>#responses[0] | 200 success catch= False WHEN: 按路径参数 flight_id 在航班表里查到了条目 BODY: {"description": "Airline-Flight 表里该航班的完整条目（id、departureDate/arrivalDate、departureAirportCode/Name/City/Locale、arrivalAirportCode/Name/City/Locale、ticketPrice、ticketCurrency、flightNumber、seatCapacity、maximumSeating），数值型属性由 Decimal 还原成 int/float"}
 RESP GET /flights/<flight_id>#responses[1] | 400 error catch= False WHEN: flight_id 在航班表里不存在（或读表异常被 storage 层吞成 None）：CatalogService.get_flight 抛 ValueError，由 app 级 errorhandler 变成 400 BODY: {"fields": ["error", "type"], "description": "error 是 'Flight with ID <flight_id> not found'，type 是 'ValueError'"}
 DA: [{"operation": "get_item", "table": "Airline-Flight-{stage}", "index": null}]
 RULE GET /flights/<flight_id>#business_rules[0] | authorization | 端点不带任何认证装饰器，任何人只要知道 flight_id 就能读到航班详情
 RULE GET /flights/<flight_id>#business_rules[1] | data_scope | 只按主键 id 读 Airline-Flight 表的单个条目，没有二级索引、没有过滤或排序，返回的就是表里存的那条记录
 RULE GET /flights/<flight_id>#business_rules[2] | error_handling | flight_id 查不到时抛 ValueError('Flight with ID <id> not found')，经 app 级 errorhandler 返回 400 + {error, type}，不是 404
 RULE GET /flights/<flight_id>#business_rules[3] | error_handling | storage 层把 DynamoDB 读异常吞掉只返回 None，所以“读表失败”和“航班不存在”外部都表现为同一个 400，客户端无法区分
========== POST /flights/<flight_id>/reserve
REQ: {"path_params": [{"name": "flight_id", "type": "string", "required": true}]}
 RESP POST /flights/<flight_id>/reserve#responses[0] | 200 success catch= False WHEN: 航班的 seatCapacity 大于 0 且存在，原子递减成功 BODY: {"fields": ["status"], "description": "固定为 {\"status\": \"SUCCESS\"}，不返回递减后的剩余座位数"}
 RESP POST /flights/<flight_id>/reserve#responses[1] | 400 error catch= False WHEN: 两种情况共用此臂：航班不存在，或 seatCapacity 已经为 0（ConditionExpression 失败）；抛 ValueError 后由 app 级 errorhandler 返回 400 BODY: {"fields": ["error", "type"], "description": "error 是 'Flight <flight_id> is fully booked or does not exist'，type 是 'ValueError'"}
 RESP POST /flights/<flight_id>/reserve#responses[2] | 400 error catch= False WHEN: DynamoDB update_item 抛非条件失败异常（例如表不存在、权限不够），被包成 ValueError('Failed to reserve seat: ...')，经 errorhandler 返回 400 BODY: {"fields": ["error", "type"], "description": "error 以 'Failed to reserve seat: ' 开头，type 是 'ValueError'"}
 DA: [{"operation": "update_item", "table": "Airline-Flight-{stage}", "index": null}]
 RULE POST /flights/<flight_id>/reserve#business_rules[0] | authorization | 端点不要认证，任何人都可以对任意 flight_id 扣一个座位
 RULE POST /flights/<flight_id>/reserve#business_rules[1] | data_scope | 订座就是一次原子递减：对 Airline-Flight 表主键 id=flight_id 的条目执行 SET seatCapacity = seatCapacity - 1，条件为 seatCapacity > 0 AND attribute_exists(id)；条件不满足则一行也不改
 RULE POST /flights/<flight_id>/reserve#business_rules[2] | computation | 并发下不允许超卖：两个并发订座只有 seatCapacity 足够的那个能成功，另一个会收到 400（依赖 DynamoDB 条件更新，而不是先读后写）
 RULE POST /flights/<flight_id>/reserve#business_rules[3] | error_handling | “航班不存在”和“已满座”两种情况被同一条件检查合并，对外都返回 'Flight <id> is fully booked or does not exist'，调用方区分不了
 RULE POST /flights/<flight_id>/reserve#business_rules[4] | side_effect | 除了 seatCapacity 外不写任何预订记录，也不记是谁占的座；单独调这个端点占的座位无法回收（除非再调 release）
 RULE POST /flights/<flight_id>/reserve#business_rules[5] | error_handling | 条件失败以外的任何 DynamoDB 异常也被转成 ValueError（'Failed to reserve seat: ...'），因此这个端点永远不会返回 5xx
========== POST /flights/<flight_id>/release
REQ: {"path_params": [{"name": "flight_id", "type": "string", "required": true}]}
 RESP POST /flights/<flight_id>/release#responses[0] | 200 success catch= False WHEN: 航班存在且 seatCapacity < maximumSeating，原子递增成功 BODY: {"fields": ["status"], "description": "固定为 {\"status\": \"SUCCESS\"}，不返回释放后的 seatCapacity"}
 RESP POST /flights/<flight_id>/release#responses[1] | 400 error catch= False WHEN: 按 flight_id 读不到航班（不存在，或读表异常被 storage 吞成 None）：先抛 ValueError('Flight <id> does not exist')，经 errorhandler 返回 400，后面的 update 不发生 BODY: {"fields": ["error", "type"], "description": "error 是 'Flight <flight_id> does not exist'，type 是 'ValueError'"}
 RESP POST /flights/<flight_id>/release#responses[2] | 400 error catch= False WHEN: seatCapacity 已经等于 maximumSeating（条件 seatCapacity < :max 失败）：ValueError('Cannot release seat, already at maximum capacity') → 400 BODY: {"fields": ["error", "type"], "description": "error 是 'Cannot release seat, already at maximum capacity'，type 是 'ValueError'"}
 RESP POST /flights/<flight_id>/release#responses[3] | 400 error catch= False WHEN: DynamoDB update_item 抛非条件失败异常，被包成 ValueError('Failed to release seat: ...')，经 errorhandler 返回 400 BODY: {"fields": ["error", "type"], "description": "error 以 'Failed to release seat: ' 开头，type 是 'ValueError'"}
 DA: [{"operation": "update_item", "table": "Airline-Flight-{stage}", "index": null}, {"operation": "get_item", "table": "Airline-Flight-{stage}", "index": null}]
 RULE POST /flights/<flight_id>/release#business_rules[0] | authorization | 端点不要认证，任何人都可以释放任意航班的座位
 RULE POST /flights/<flight_id>/release#business_rules[1] | data_scope | 释放是一次带条件的原子递增：seatCapacity = seatCapacity + 1，条件 seatCapacity < maximumSeating，不会把可座数加到超过航班当初的最大座位数
 RULE POST /flights/<flight_id>/release#business_rules[2] | computation | 上限值取自该航班条目自己的 maximumSeating 字段（不是配置常量），所以不同航班的上限不同
 RULE POST /flights/<flight_id>/release#business_rules[3] | error_handling | 与 reserve 不同，release 会先 get_item 读一次航班再写：航班不存在时报 'Flight <id> does not exist'，而不是报 'fully booked or does not exist'
 RULE POST /flights/<flight_id>/release#business_rules[4] | error_handling | 已满座（seatCapacity 等于 maximumSeating）时再释放不改数据，返回 400 'Cannot release seat, already at maximum capacity'，所以 release 不是幂等的
 RULE POST /flights/<flight_id>/release#business_rules[5] | validation | 释放不校验请求者是否持有该座位，也不要求存在对应预订，重复释放会把座位数抬到上限

========== POST /bookings
REQ: {"body": [{"name": "outboundFlightId", "type": "string", "required": true, "note": "当作航班表主键用；缺失不是 400，而是在 data['outboundFlightId'] 取键时抛 KeyError → 500"}, {"name": "chargeId", "type": "string", "required": true, "note": "既存进 booking.paymentToken，也传给 collect_payment；缺失会在 Step 2 被 validate_booking_request 拦下（此时 Step 1 已把座位扣了）"}, {"name": "customerId", "type": "string", "required": false, "note": "脚本当作必填字段，实际不是：handler 无条件用登录用户的 sub 覆写它，传了也会被丢弃，不传也能成功"}], "headers": [{"name": "Authorization", "type": "string", "required": true, "note": "'Bearer <JWT>'，由 login_required 校验；令牌里的 sub 决定了 customerId"}]}
 RESP POST /bookings#responses[0] | 401 error catch= False WHEN: login_required 不通过：没有 Authorization 头、头里没有第二个空格分段、令牌过期/无效，或令牌 sub 在用户表查不到；此时不碰任何业务表 BODY: {"fields": ["error"], "description": "缺头时 error='Authentication required. Please provide a valid token.'；格式错时 'Invalid token format. Use: Bearer <token>'；令牌无效时 'Invalid or expired token'"}
 RESP POST /bookings#responses[1] | 400 error catch= False WHEN: 请求体缺失、不是 JSON 或解析结果为空（if not data） BODY: {"fields": ["error"], "description": "error='Request body is required'"}
 RESP POST /bookings#responses[2] | 400 error catch= True WHEN: Step 1 失败：outboundFlightId 对应的航班不存在或 seatCapacity 已为 0（reserve_flight_seat 抛 ValueError），无需回滚因为还没有任何写入 BODY: {"fields": ["error", "step"], "description": "error 以 'Flight reservation failed: ' 开头，step='Reserve Flight'"}
 RESP POST /bookings#responses[3] | 400 error catch= True WHEN: Step 2 失败：reserve_booking 抛 ValueError（body 缺 outboundFlightId/customerId/chargeId 之一，或 put_item 写失败）。回滚：先 release_flight_seat 把刚占的座位退回，释放失败只记日志 BODY: {"fields": ["error", "step"], "description": "error 以 'Booking reservation failed: ' 开头，step='Reserve Booking'，没有 bookingId 字段"}
 RESP POST /bookings#responses[4] | 400 error catch= True WHEN: Step 3 失败：collect_payment 抛 ValueError（chargeId 为空假值或 Stripe 报错）。回滚：cancel_booking 把预订置 CANCELLED，再 release_flight_seat 退回座位，两步失败都只记日志 BODY: {"fields": ["error", "step", "bookingId"], "description": "error 以 'Payment failed: ' 开头，step='Collect Payment'，bookingId 是那条已被建出来又被打成 CANCELLED 的预订 id"}
 RESP POST /bookings#responses[5] | 500 error catch= True WHEN: Step 4 失败：confirm_booking 抛任何异常（收款已成功）。回滚顺序是 refund_payment → cancel_booking → release_flight_seat，三步失败都只记日志 BODY: {"fields": ["error", "step", "bookingId", "message"], "description": "error 以 'Booking confirmation failed: ' 开头，step='Confirm Booking'，message='Payment has been refunded'"}
 RESP POST /bookings#responses[6] | 201 success catch= False WHEN: 前四步全部成功（扣座→建 UNCONFIRMED 预订→收款→确认）；Step 5 积分、Step 6 通知失败不会阻止 201 BODY: {"fields": ["bookingId", "bookingReference", "status", "payment", "notification"], "description": "bookingId 是 uuid4，bookingReference 是新生的 secrets.token_urlsafe(4) 随机串，status 固定 'CONFIRMED'，payment 是 collect_payment 的返回（模拟模式下 {receiptUrl, price}），notification 是 notify_booking 的返回"}
 RESP POST /bookings#responses[7] | 500 error catch= True WHEN: 冒到最外层 except 的意外异常（例如 body 缺 outboundFlightId 时 data['outboundFlightId'] 取键抛 KeyError，不属于上面任何一个 except ValueError 分支）。按 payment_result/booking_id/flight_reserved 三个标记尽力回滚 BODY: {"fields": ["error", "message"], "description": "error 以 'Unexpected error during booking: ' 开头，message='The booking has been rolled back. Please try again.'；不返回 bookingId"}
 DA: [{"operation": "update_item", "table": "Airline-Flight-{stage}", "index": null}, {"operation": "put_item", "table": "Airline-Booking-{stage}", "index": null}, {"operation": "get_item", "table": "Airline-Booking-{stage}", "index": null}, {"operation": "update_item", "table": "Airline-Booking-{stage}", "index": null}, {"operation": "update_item", "table": "Airline-Flight-{stage}", "index": null}, {"operation": "put_item", "table": "Airline-Loyalty-{stage}", "index": null}, {"operation": "update_item", "table": "Airline-Booking-{stage}", "index": null}, {"operation": "get_item", "table": "Airline-Flight-{stage}", "index": null}]
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[0] | authorization | 必须携带有效的 Bearer JWT（login_required）：没有 Authorization 头、头里没有第二个空格分段、令牌过期或无效、或令牌 sub 在用户表里查不到，都返回 401 且不碰任何业务表
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[1] | authorization | customerId 不由调用方控制：handler 把请求体里的 customerId 覆写为登录用户的 sub，客户端传了也会被丢弃；预订只能建在自己名下
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[2] | validation | 请求体必须存在且非空，否则直接 400 'Request body is required'，不会碰任何表
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[3] | validation | 建单字段齐备性由 BookingService.validate_booking_request 统一要求：outboundFlightId、customerId、chargeId 三个字段缺任何一个都抛 ValueError（'Invalid booking request: missing required fields'）
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[4] | data_scope | 新建的预订写入 Airline-Booking 表：id=uuid4、bookingOutboundFlightId=请求的 outboundFlightId、customer=登录用户 sub、paymentToken=请求的 chargeId、status='UNCONFIRMED'、checkedIn=false、createdAt=服务器当前时间 isoformat、bookingReference=null
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[5] | side_effect | 整个建单是一个四步 Saga，外部可见的效果顺序是：先原子扣一个座位，再写 UNCONFIRMED 预订，再收款，最后把预订改成 CONFIRMED 并写入 bookingReference；正常完成时预订表条目、航班表 seatCapacity、忠诚表新积分条目、外部支付都发生了变更
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[6] | computation | bookingReference 是 4 字节 urlsafe 随机串（secrets.token_urlsafe(4)），与 bookingId(uuid4) 不同，每次确认都新生成，代码不保证不重复
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[7] | error_handling | 每一步失败都要把已生效的写入补偿回去：Step 2 失败放座；Step 3 失败取消预订+放座；Step 4 失败退款+取消预订+放座；补偿子步骤自己失败时只 print 日志，响应照旧返回，所以失败后的表状态可能残留 CANCELLED 预订或已被扣的座位
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[8] | error_handling | 确认失败的 500 响应里 message 写死 'Payment has been refunded'，即使上一行退款抛异常被吞掉、实际没退款也这么说
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[9] | side_effect | Step 5 加忠诚分（积分值=int(payment_result.price)，模拟模式下 price 固定 150）失败时只记日志，不影响 201；预订已 CONFIRMED 但客户可能拿不到积分
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[10] | side_effect | Step 6 通知只是本地拼装的一个 dict（不落库、不发邮件），失败时被顶为 {'status':'failed','error':...} 后仍返回 201；成功时 notification 里 status='confirmed'、subject 含 bookingReference
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[11] | error_handling | 冒到最外层的异常走 catch-all：按 payment_result/booking_id/flight_reserved 三个标记依次尝试退款、取消预订、放座，然后返回 500 'Unexpected error during booking'；这个分支不返回 bookingId
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[12] | error_handling | body 里没带 outboundFlightId 时不会返回 400 校验错，而是在 data['outboundFlightId'] 取键时抛 KeyError，落进 catch-all 返回 500；缺 chargeId 则在 Step 2 被拒（因为 Step 1 已经先把座位扣了）
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[13] | other | 同一个 chargeId 重复提交会重复扣座并重复收款：流程没有任何幂等键或去重检查
 RULE POST /bookings#business_rules[14] | computation | 加忠诚分用的是 payment_result.price 而不是航班表里的 ticketPrice（模拟模式下固定 150，与所订航班票价无关）
========== GET /bookings/<booking_id>
REQ: {"path_params": [{"name": "booking_id", "type": "string", "required": true}], "headers": [{"name": "Authorization", "type": "string", "required": true, "note": "'Bearer <JWT>'；booking_owner_or_admin_required 需要该用户就是预订的 customer 或在 Admin 组"}]}
 RESP GET /bookings/<booking_id>#responses[0] | 401 error catch= False WHEN: booking_owner_or_admin_required 里取不到合法用户（无 Authorization 头 / 格式错 / 令牌失效或用户不存在）；此时不读预订表之后的业务响应 BODY: {"fields": ["error"], "description": "三选一：'Authentication required. Please provide a valid token.' / 'Invalid token format. Use: Bearer <token>' / 'Invalid or expired token'"}
 RESP GET /bookings/<booking_id>#responses[1] | 404 error catch= False WHEN: 装饰器按 booking_id 读不到预订条目（storage.get_booking 返回 None，包括 DynamoDB 读异常被吞的情况） BODY: {"fields": ["error"], "description": "error='Booking not found'"}
 RESP GET /bookings/<booking_id>#responses[2] | 403 error catch= False WHEN: 预订存在，但登录用户既不是该预订的 customer（current_user['sub'] != booking['customer']）、也不在 Admin 组 BODY: {"fields": ["error"], "description": "error='Access denied. You can only access your own bookings.'"}
 RESP GET /bookings/<booking_id>#responses[3] | 200 success catch= False WHEN: 认证通过且用户是预订拥有者或 Admin（装饰器已确认预订存在） BODY: {"description": "Airline-Booking 表里的完整条目：id、bookingOutboundFlightId、customer、paymentToken、status（UNCONFIRMED/CONFIRMED/CANCELLED）、checkedIn、createdAt、bookingReference"}
 RESP GET /bookings/<booking_id>#responses[4] | 400 error catch= False WHEN: handler 里第二次读不到 booking 时 BookingService.get_booking 抛 ValueError，经全局 errorhandler 变成 400；装饰器刚刚读过同一条，所以只有两次读之间被并发删除才会走到这里 BODY: {"fields": ["error", "type"], "description": "error 形如 'Booking <id> not found'，type='ValueError'"}
 DA: [{"operation": "get_item", "table": "Airline-Booking-{stage}", "index": null}]
 RULE GET /bookings/<booking_id>#business_rules[0] | authorization | 必须是登录用户；没有有效 Bearer 令牌时返回 401，不会去读预订表
 RULE GET /bookings/<booking_id>#business_rules[1] | authorization | 只能读到自己的预订：当前用户的 sub 必须等于预订条目的 customer 字段，否则 403；用户 groups 里含 'Admin' 时可以读任意人的预订
 RULE GET /bookings/<booking_id>#business_rules[2] | error_handling | 预订不存在时返回 404（这个 404 来自装饰器里的存在性检查，不是 handler），而不是 handler 那条链上的 400
 RULE GET /bookings/<booking_id>#business_rules[3] | data_scope | 读取范围就是按主键 id 的 get_item，一次一条，不过滤字段、不排序、不分页，返回表里存的完整条目
 RULE GET /bookings/<booking_id>#business_rules[4] | other | 同一次请求里预订被读了两次：装饰器为了鉴权读一次，handler 为了响应再读一次
 RULE GET /bookings/<booking_id>#business_rules[5] | error_handling | storage.get_booking 吃掉 DynamoDB 读异常并返回 None，因此读表故障对客户端表现为 404 'Booking not found'

========== POST /bookings/<booking_id>/confirm
